note as BIZ_diagram_11_system_ops
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  A control tower over the data: a registry of every table with its
  sensitivity, retention rules and allowed write operations, plus
  anonymization rules and a generic draft store. Turns governance from
  policy into enforced practice.
end note

