note as REC_POLY_SYS_diagram_11_system_ops
  REC 3.1 — POLYMORPHIC GOVERNANCE LOG
governance_change_log/(record_revisions) use (target_type/schema+table,
target_id/record_id). Keep polymorphic (audit spans all tables) but
validate schema_name/table_name against entity_registry.
end note

note as REC_HISTORY_SYNC_diagram_11_system_ops
  REC 3.6 — HISTORY COVERAGE MUST STAY IN SYNC
entity_registry.has_history / history_table must match 1:1 the *_history
tables defined in schema audit. Add a CI check that fails if a table with
has_history=true has no corresponding audit.*_history (this gap occurred
for the module 18 clinical_ext tables).
end note

note as DATA_GOV_REF_diagram_11_system_ops
  INTERNATIONAL DATA GOVERNANCE
  Regional residency, legal hold, cross-border transfer, backup policy and
  restore-test evidence are specified in diagram_11b_data_governance.
end note

