note as RULE_diagram_11b_data_governance
  GOVERNANCE RULE
  RPO/RTO are business-approved policy values, not hard-coded defaults.
  Backup completion is insufficient evidence: restore tests and measured
  recovery objectives are retained as operational records.
end note

